-------------------------------------------------

WWBBSChat v1.5
Chat programs for WWBBS

-------------------------------------------------

Use
DOSCOMMAND WWBBS:WWBBSChat $NODE
in WWBBS command menu`

WWBBSChat ?
NODE/A,STARTMSG,ABORTMSG,DISABLEMSG,ENDMSG,WINDOW:

NODE
STARTMSG       default "\r\n~sPlease wait, I am calling Sysop "
ABORTMSG       default "\r\n\r\nAbort\r\n"
DISABLEMSG     default "\r\n~sSorry, Sysop is not here\r\n"
ENDMSG         default "\r\n\r\n~pEnd Chat Sysop\r\n"
WINDOWS        default "RAW:///128/Chat "
warning: WWBBSChat append REALNAME after open windows
ex: "RAW:///128/Chat Giuseppe Vicari"

Stop Time in ChatMode ;)

-------------------------------------------------

WWBBSCtrlChat v1.1
Control Chat programs for WWBBSChat

-------------------------------------------------

You can enable/disable char programs, no beeps, no windows

Use
ACTION=Enable/Disable Chat,WWBBSCtrlChat "%s"
in Tools Type of WWBBS.info

Use Cli Mode
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name>

warning: If Amiga Reboot all chat are Enable

WWBBSCtrlChat ?
NODE/A
